# Runtime and scratch
.internal/
**/.run/
*.log

# A Python script at the repository root is a stray. Temporary scripts,
# probes and experiments belong in .internal/scratch/ (or the session's
# scratchpad), and the root tree stays short enough that the README is
# reached on GitHub without scrolling past them. This keeps a stray off the
# remote; it does not stop one being created, and `git status` will not show
# it, so the local tree still wants an occasional look.
/*.py

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Claude Code local overrides — machine-specific, never shared
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor and OS residue
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT ignored, deliberately
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# plugins/*/templates/     the artifact templates a target project receives.
#                          They look like generated output and are not — they
#                          are the source of truth for what setup installs.
# plugins/*/scripts/       the checks and the guard, including their negative
#                          controls. A control that is not shipped cannot be
#                          run by whoever doubts the check.
# .claude-plugin/          the marketplace and plugin manifests.
